      "year": 2018,
      "abstract": "In this thesis the development, design and characterisation of a micro-Newton thruster test facility was presented. The facility consists of the required vacuum infrastructure, a highly precise and highly stable micro-Newton thrust balance and a set of plasma diagnostics. Measurement results of real thruster tests that has been performed with the facility has been shown and analysed.",
